    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/aa/Eurydice_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240906212939\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Eurydice Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"1037\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Eurydice Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Eurydice_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/aa/Eurydice_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240906212939\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eJustice Crusader\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAn executioner dressed in pure white who strongly believes in her own actions. As someone who does away with unrighteous justice, she unleashes flames than mercilessly destroys evil.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"ae5b3b6150bca1bc44a1b909c7c56fd2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Eurydice_S_Queen-s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:74px; top:0.5px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"